{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-005",
    "title": "废井之下"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_020",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“先别交给沈砚秋。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "外门弟子入门后的第三个夜晚，开始轮值巡灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 457,
          "end": 457
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗的山道从山门一直绕到后山，沿途每隔十丈挂一盏引路灯。灯罩用青铜铸成，内里灌着不会凝固的灯油。只要灯火不灭，夜行弟子便能看见石阶；若有一盏熄灭，值夜的人必须在一炷香内重新点亮。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 459,
          "end": 459
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临领到巡灯牌时，天上没有月亮。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 461,
          "end": 461
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他负责哪一段？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 481,
          "end": 481
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "值房里的人没有回答。一个年长弟子把名册合上，推到桌角：“外门弟子不查旧值。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 483,
          "end": 483
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那他现在在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 485,
          "end": 485
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不在值房。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 487,
          "end": 487
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“什么时候回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 489,
          "end": 489
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“该回来的时候自然会回。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 491,
          "end": 491
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这句话和沈砚秋在登记堂说过的话相似得让陆照临心里发沉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 493,
          "end": 493
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他离开值房时，听见身后有人低声说：“陆师兄昨夜也没回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 495,
          "end": 495
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别说了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 497,
          "end": 497
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可名册上——”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 499,
          "end": 499
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门被猛地关上，声音在空山里传出很远。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 501,
          "end": 501
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有回听雨院。他沿西侧小径走了一段，直到第三盏灯后的石阶被一扇木栅栏拦住。栅栏上挂着封条，封条的朱砂已经被雨水冲淡，仍能辨认出“戒律堂封闭”几个字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 503,
          "end": 503
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "木栅栏外的泥地上有两行湿脚印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 505,
          "end": 505
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一行通向值房，一行拐进杂木林。前一行鞋底平整，是宗门制式短靴；后一行鞋印较深，脚跟拖地，像有人受伤后强行走过。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 507,
          "end": 507
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临蹲在脚印旁，用木牌量了量间距。那脚印比他的长半寸，左脚外侧有一道缺口，正与第三盏灯断裂的灯芯旁留下的划痕相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 509,
          "end": 509
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他正要沿杂木林追去，身后传来脚步声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 511,
          "end": 511
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋提着一盏小灯站在石阶上。她没有穿执事袍，只披了一件深灰斗篷，雨水从斗篷边缘落下，把她的鞋面打湿。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 513,
          "end": 513
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“新弟子不该来这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 515,
          "end": 515
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我在巡灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 517,
          "end": 517
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你的巡灯范围不包括西坡。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 519,
          "end": 519
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯在我的路上。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 521,
          "end": 521
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋看了一眼栅栏，伸手按住封条。封条无风自颤，发出细小的纸响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 523,
          "end": 523
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你看见什么？”她问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 525,
          "end": 525
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起登记堂里的三行空白，想起那句“玄霄宗没有这个人”。他可以把断灯芯和脚印交出去，也可以先藏住，自己查清楚再说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 527,
          "end": 527
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我看见第三盏灯的灯芯断了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 529,
          "end": 529
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还有呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 531,
          "end": 531
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“两行脚印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 533,
          "end": 533
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还有呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 535,
          "end": 535
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一行通向杂木林。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 537,
          "end": 537
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有问他是否认识脚印的主人，只从袖中取出一枚临时木签。木签正面刻着“协查”，背面刻着“不得入井”。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 539,
          "end": 539
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“拿着它，沿外门范围找一遍。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 541,
          "end": 541
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 543,
          "end": 543
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋的手指在木签上停了一下：“你从哪里听来的名字？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 545,
          "end": 545
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“值房名册。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 547,
          "end": 547
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那是旧记录。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 549,
          "end": 549
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“旧记录为什么还没有归还巡灯牌？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 551,
          "end": 551
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她抬头看他，眼里的疲惫比登记那天更重。过了片刻，她说：“因为有人没有回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 553,
          "end": 553
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“死了吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 555,
          "end": 555
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我没有确认。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 557,
          "end": 557
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这是她第一次给出没有被准备好的答案。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 559,
          "end": 559
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看着她手里的小灯。那盏灯的灯油颜色很深，灯罩内壁却干净得没有一点烟灰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 561,
          "end": 561
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你知道他去了哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 563,
          "end": 563
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只知道他最后一次被记录在西坡。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 565,
          "end": 565
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“什么时候？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 567,
          "end": 567
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“子时之前。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 569,
          "end": 569
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“之后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 571,
          "end": 571
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“之后的记录被覆盖了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 573,
          "end": 573
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她说完，便转身往回走。走出几步后，她像想起什么，又回头补了一句：“如果你在林中找到任何灯具碎片，先别触碰，叫我来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 575,
          "end": 575
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临握住临时木签。木签边缘有一道被刀削过的缺口，形状与顾长离从账单上取下的铜印缺口相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 577,
          "end": 577
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋离开后，杂木林里传来一声金属碰撞。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 579,
          "end": 579
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "铜环上刻着细密的横纹，和第三章那张顾氏账单上的印记一致。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 583,
          "end": 583
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有追。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 589,
          "end": 589
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离先看灯芯，再看铜环。她的眉头微不可察地皱了一下，伸手却没有碰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 629,
          "end": 629
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“铜环从哪里来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 631,
          "end": 631
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“杂木林。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 633,
          "end": 633
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁给你的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 635,
          "end": 635
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它自己滚过来的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 637,
          "end": 637
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有笑：“这不是答案。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 639,
          "end": 639
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只看见它从泥里滚出一寸。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 641,
          "end": 641
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她蹲下，用一根枯枝拨开铜环上的泥。横纹之间嵌着黑色细屑，与第三章账单缺口中的印泥相同。她把枯枝折成两段，将铜环挑进一张纸里包好。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 643,
          "end": 643
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先别交给沈砚秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 645,
          "end": 645
        }
      }
    ],
